    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yohana aconshomera agatabo yavanye mu ntoki za marayika",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mbona marayika wundi ukomeye amanuka ava mu ijuru yambaye igicu, umukororombya uri ku mutwe we, mu maso he hasa n'izuba, ibirenge bye bisa n'inkingi z'umuriro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu intoki ze yari afite agatabo kabumbutse. Nuko ashyira ikirenge cye cy'iburyo ku nyanja, n'icy'ibumoso agishyira ku butaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arangurura ijwi rirenga nk'uko intare yivuga, avuze iryo jwi rirenga guhinda kurindwi kw'inkuba kuvuga amajwi yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi guhinda kurindwi kw'inkuba kumaze kuvuga, nari ngiye kwandika nuko numva ijwi rivugira mu ijuru rimbwira riti “Iby' uko guhinda kurindwi kw'inkuba kuvuze ubizigame, bibe ubwiru ntubyandike.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
