        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n        Ezek 2.8—3.3\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Nuko rya jwi numvise rivugira mu ijuru, nongera kuryumva rimbwira riti “Genda wende ka gatabo kabumbutse kari mu intoki za marayika uhagaze ku nyanja no ku butaka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nuko nsanga marayika uwo ndamubwira nti “Mpa ako gatabo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aransubiza ati “Enda ugaconshomere, karagusharirira mu nda ariko mu kanwa kawe karakuryohera nk'ubuki.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nenda ako gatabo, ngakura mu intoki za marayika ndagaconshomera. Mu kanwa kanjye karyohera nk'ubuki, ariko maze kukarya mu nda yanjye harasharirirwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Arambwira ati “Ukwiriye kongera guhanura iby'amoko menshi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "iby'amoko menshi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "cyangwa, imbere y'amoko menshi.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " n'amahanga menshi, n'indimi nyinshi n'abami benshi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
